        "text": "Step 11: There are 992 such pairs from 1 to 1984, and the last term is \\( f(1985) \\):\n\\[ f(1) + f(2) + \\cdots + f(1985) = 992 \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} + f(1985). \\]"
      },
      {
